      }
    },
    {
      "type": "quotation",
      "text": "고치 캔디드넛 (Non Vegan)\n풍미가득 버터향+달콤한메이플시럽",
      "style": {
        "classes": [
          "se-ff-",
          "se-fs-",
          "se-l-quotation_line"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "count": 1,
